{"unit_id":"tag:06YV:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设\n<MATH_0001>\n为赋环拓扑斯的态射（morphism of ringed topoi）。可使用 K-平坦（K-flat）分解（resolutions）定义导出拉回（derived pullback）函子（functor）\n<MATH_0002>\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"morphism of ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯的态射"},{"source_term":"K-flat","target_term":"K-平坦"},{"source_term":"resolutions","target_term":"分解"},{"source_term":"derived pullback","target_term":"导出拉回"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"morphism of ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯的态射","context":"拉回所对应态射"},{"source_term":"K-flat","target_term":"K-平坦","context":"分解性质"},{"source_term":"resolutions","target_term":"分解","context":"构造导出函子的分解"},{"source_term":"derived pullback","target_term":"导出拉回","context":"定义的导出运算"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"导出拉回函子"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0G7E:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为赋环拓扑斯的态射（morphism of ringed topoi）。设 <MATH_0002> 为 K-平坦（K-flat）复形（complex），由 <MATH_0003>-模（modules）组成，其各项（terms）为平坦（flat）的 <MATH_0004>-模（modules）。则 <MATH_0005> 为 K-平坦（K-flat）复形（complex），由 <MATH_0006>-模（modules）组成，其各项（terms）为平坦（flat）的 <MATH_0007>-模（modules）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"morphism of ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯的态射"},{"source_term":"K-flat","target_term":"K-平坦"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"terms","target_term":"项"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"K-flat","target_term":"K-平坦"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"terms","target_term":"项"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"morphism of ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯的态射","context":"拉回对应的态射"},{"source_term":"K-flat","target_term":"K-平坦","context":"拉回保持的性质"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形","context":"拉回前后复形"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"两侧系数模"},{"source_term":"terms","target_term":"项","context":"复形各项"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"复形各项性质"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0G7E:proof","translation":"各项（terms）<MATH_0001> 为平坦（flat）的 <MATH_0002>-模（modules），见《位点上的模（Modules on Sites）》引理 <REF_0001>。选取图式（diagram）\n<MATH_0003>\n如引理 <REF_0002> 所述。我们将使用该引理陈述的所有性质，不再逐次提及。每个 <MATH_0004> 均为由平坦模（flat modules）组成的上有界（bounded above）复形（complex），见《位点上的模（Modules on Sites）》引理 <REF_0003>。考虑复形（complexes）的短正合列（short exact sequence）\n<MATH_0005>\n它定义 <MATH_0006>。由引理 <REF_0004> 和 <REF_0005>，复形（complex）<MATH_0007> 为 K-平坦（K-flat）的；由《位点上的模（Modules on Sites）》引理 <REF_0006>，其各项（terms）平坦（flat）。由《位点上的模（Modules on Sites）》引理 <REF_0007>，<MATH_0008> 的各项（terms）平坦（flat）；由引理 <REF_0008>，<MATH_0009> 为 K-平坦（K-flat）的；由长正合（long exact）上同调（cohomology）序列（sequence），<MATH_0010> 无上同调（acyclic）（因为第二个箭头（arrow）为拟同构（quasi-isomorphism））。拉回（pullback）\n<MATH_0011>\n是下有界（bounded below）复形（complexes）的余极限（colimit），这些复形由平坦（flat）的 <MATH_0012>-模（modules）组成，因此它为 K-平坦（K-flat）的（由与上述相同的引理）。我们的短正合列（short exact sequence）的拉回（pullback）\n<MATH_0013>\n是复形（complexes）的短正合列（short exact sequence），见《位点上的模（Modules on Sites）》引理 <REF_0009>。因此，由引理 <REF_0010>，只需证明 <MATH_0014> 为 K-平坦（K-flat）的。这将问题归结为下一段所讨论的情形。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n假设 <MATH_0015> 无上同调（acyclic）且 K-平坦（K-flat），各项（terms）平坦（flat）。于是引理 <REF_0011> 保证 <MATH_0016> 的所有项（terms）均为平坦（flat）的 <MATH_0017>-模（modules）。选取上述图式（diagram），并使用上文对此图式（diagram）证明的所有性质。以 <MATH_0018> 表示复形（complexes）的映射（map）\n<MATH_0019>\n的核（kernel），于是有复形（complexes）的短正合列（short exact sequences）\n<MATH_0020>\n由《位点上的模（Modules on Sites）》引理 <REF_0012>，可见复形（complex）<MATH_0021> 的各项（terms）平坦（flat）。因此可见，在此情形下，<MATH_0022> 是下有界（bounded below）复形（complexes）的滤过余极限（filtered colimit），这些复形由平坦模（flat modules）组成。从而 <MATH_0023> 为 K-平坦（K-flat）的（论证与上文相同），得证。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"terms","target_term":"项"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"位点上的模"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图式"},{"source_term":"flat modules","target_term":"平坦模"},{"source_term":"bounded above","target_term":"上有界"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"位点上的模"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"short exact sequence","target_term":"短正合列"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"K-flat","target_term":"K-平坦"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"位点上的模"},{"source_term":"terms","target_term":"项"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"位点上的模"},{"source_term":"terms","target_term":"项"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"K-flat","target_term":"K-平坦"},{"source_term":"long exact","target_term":"长正合"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"sequence","target_term":"序列"},{"source_term":"acyclic","target_term":"无上同调"},{"source_term":"arrow","target_term":"箭头"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphism","target_term":"拟同构"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"拉回"},{"source_term":"bounded below","target_term":"下有界"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"colimit","target_term":"余极限"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"K-flat","target_term":"K-平坦"},{"source_term":"short exact sequence","target_term":"短正合列"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"拉回"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"short exact sequence","target_term":"短正合列"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"位点上的模"},{"source_term":"K-flat","target_term":"K-平坦"},{"source_term":"acyclic","target_term":"无上同调"},{"source_term":"K-flat","target_term":"K-平坦"},{"source_term":"terms","target_term":"项"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"terms","target_term":"项"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图式"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图式"},{"source_term":"c